        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Leonard Wilson Keenan \r\n\r\nOur Business is you \r\n\r\n2 Bedroom | 1 Bathroom | Extended Ground Floor Apartment\r\nCentral Location \r\n\r\nRichard Todd and Leonard Wilson Keenan are delighted to present 5 Saint Joseph's Square to the Dublin 3 property market.\r\nNestled in the highly sought-after Saint Joseph's Square, this extended ground floor apartment offers a rare opportunity to acquire a charming home in one of Clontarf's most desirable residential locations. Set within a quiet and private square, this property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, investors, and those looking to downsize without compromising on location.\r\n\r\nUpon arrival, you are greeted by the property's attractive red brick façade, with the added benefit of its own private entrance directly from the street.\r\n\r\nInternally, the accommodation is both bright and well-proportioned. The welcoming front living room enjoys a large window overlooking the front of the property, allowing natural light to flood the space. Off the hallway are two generous double bedrooms. The principal bedroom overlooks the property's  extended breakfast nook, while the second double bedroom offers excellent flexibility for family living, guests, or a home office.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, the home opens into a spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area, enhanced by a thoughtfully designed extension that creates an ideal space for everyday living and entertaining. The accommodation is completed by a well-appointed family bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside, a private rear courtyard garden provides a peaceful retreat, perfect for relaxing with a morning coffee, outdoor dining, or entertaining family and friends.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none. Situated in the very heart of Clontarf, Saint Joseph's Square enjoys a peaceful setting while being just moments from an excellent range of local amenities. Residents are within walking distance of an array of cafés, restaurants, boutiques, supermarkets, and excellent schools.\r\n\r\nFor outdoor enthusiasts, the stunning Clontarf Promenade and Seafront offer scenic walks and cycle routes along Dublin Bay, while nearby St. Anne's Park provides extensive parkland, sporting facilities, and weekend markets.\r\n\r\nTransport links are exceptional, with numerous Dublin Bus routes servicing the area and Clontarf Road DART Station just a short stroll away, providing quick and convenient access to Dublin City Centre and beyond. Dublin City Centre, the IFSC, East Point Business Park, Dublin Airport, and the M50 motorway are all easily accessible.\r\n\r\nThis property presents a fantastic opportunity to establish a foothold in one of Dublin's most prestigious coastal suburbs, combining character, convenience, and lifestyle in equal measure.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
